/**
 * TRIPLE-NEGATIVE BREAST CANCER: the core layer of the six-file deep dive (24 Sept 2026), written to the standard of
 * the gallbladder files (docs/GALLBLADDER-QA.md). The cancer record `tnbc` already exists in ../cancers.ts and is the
 * deepest page on the site, so this file PATCHES it (cancerId "tnbc") rather than replacing it: the epidemiology, risk
 * factors, presentation, diagnosis and pathology, staging, screening and prevention, outlook figures and the FAQ are
 * added here with their sources; the treatment rows, history and pipeline written earlier stay as they are. The
 * `summary` scalar necessarily overrides the one in cancers.ts (spike scalars win), so the three paragraphs written
 * there are carried over verbatim at the top of the new summary; edit them here, not in cancers.ts.
 *
 *   subtypes (parent tnbc)  tnbc-basal-like-1, tnbc-basal-like-2, tnbc-mesenchymal, tnbc-mesenchymal-stem-like,
 *                           tnbc-luminal-androgen-receptor, tnbc-immunomodulatory (Lehmann 2011 and 2016);
 *                           metaplastic-breast-carcinoma, medullary-pattern-breast-carcinoma,
 *                           adenoid-cystic-carcinoma-breast, apocrine-carcinoma-breast, secretory-carcinoma-breast
 *                           (WHO 2019 special types that are usually triple-negative); brca-associated-tnbc
 *   terms                   er-pr-negative-threshold, her2-low-and-trop2-adc-eligibility-tnbc, pd-l1-cps-10-tnbc,
 *                           hrd-in-breast-cancer, germline-brca-testing-criteria-tnbc, ki-67-in-tnbc,
 *                           basal-like, claudin-low, androgen-receptor-positive-tnbc,
 *                           ajcc-prognostic-stage-breast, interval-breast-cancer, risk-reducing-surgery-brca-carriers,
 *                           chemoprevention-and-er-negative-breast-cancer; and, at the evidence file's request,
 *                           founder-mutation, idfs, luminal-androgen-receptor, pd-l1-assay-discordance,
 *                           exceptional-responder, health-disparities
 *   supplements             pcr, rcb (the TNBC figures added to the existing glossary terms)
 *
 * PD-L1-positive and HER2-low states are NOT created here: the biomarker kind already carries pd-l1-cps, her2-low-ihc,
 * her2-ihc-0, er-status, pr-status, ki-67-index, brca-germline and hrd-positive (src/data/biomarker-readouts.ts) and
 * the tumour-board states pdl1-cps10, her2-low, tils-high and gbrca (src/data/biomarkers.ts).
 *
 * Every figure is quoted from the page or abstract named beside it: SEER Cancer Stat Facts (female breast cancer
 * subtypes), Cancer Research UK statistics and patient pages, the GLOBOCAN breast fact sheet (served as the 2024
 * estimates, read 24 Sept 2026), NHS screening pages, NICE CG164, NG101, NG12 and the technology appraisals, and
 * papers read through the Europe PMC REST API (cached under /tmp/tnbc). Where sources disagree, both are recorded.
 */
